sequenceDiagram
    participant A as CRM screen
    participant G as Gateway
    participant S as Churn API
    participant M as Model
    participant C as churn_scores
    participant P as Prometheus

    A->>G: POST /v1/churn/score
    G->>S: forward, 300 ms timeout
    S->>S: validate (Pydantic)
    alt request invalid
        S-->>A: 422 + field errors
    else model healthy
        S->>M: predict_proba(x)
        M-->>S: p, top-3 reasons
        S-->>A: 200 {probability, risk_band, reasons,<br/>model_version, fallback=false}
    else model unavailable / timeout
        S->>C: last weekly score
        alt score ≤ 7 days old
            C-->>S: cached score
            S-->>A: 200 {..., fallback="last_batch"}
        else no score
            S->>S: rule scorecard
            S-->>A: 200 {..., fallback="scorecard"}
        end
    end
    S-)P: latency, fallback count
